==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|разъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|разъ|t=strike}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*razъ}}. Akin to {{m|ru|рази́ть}}, {{m|ru|ре́зать}}. For a different semantic shift, compare {{cog|pl|raz}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|sla-pro|*brojiti}}, {{m|sla-pro|*brojь}} (akin to {{m|sla-pro|*briti}}, whence {{m|ru|брить}}, << {{m+|ine-pro|*bʰreyH-}}). Also compare {{m+|en|tally}} (<< {{m+|la|tāliō}}, which is a distant source of {{m|ru|та́лия}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-раз.ogg}}
* {{homophones|ru|рас}}
* {{rhymes|ru|as|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c||(2)|par=+|adj=ра́зовый|dim=разо́к,ра́зик}}

# [[time]] {{gloss|an instance or occurrence}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[два]] '''ра́за'''|twice}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ещё]] '''раз'''|once more; one more time}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ни]] '''ра́зу'''|not once; never}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не]] '''раз'''|repeatedly}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[как]] '''раз'''|just; just in time}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[за]] '''раз'''|at a time}}
# [[one]] {{qualifier|in counting}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''раз''', [[два]], [[три]] ... [[марш]]!|one, two, three ... go!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''раз''', [[два]], [[три]], [[ого́нь]]!|one, two, three, fire!}}

